==Description==
The '''Molten Nametag''' is a nametag that was obtained from a [[Molten Boss Mini Plush]] code.

The '''Molten Nametag''' has orange text and a dark orange outline. The '''Molten Nametag''' has flames and black smoke appear from it, making it look like it is burning. It also emits small orange dots that move around it.

